            <ArticleTitle>Coronary-coronary bypass: theoretical basis and techniques.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>333-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The authors present their experience with coronary-coronary bypass grafting. This technique takes advantage of physiological position of the right coronary artery ostium. The filling of the graft and of the coronary circulation is assisted by several factors promoting the physiological diastolic coronary artery blood flow.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
